{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/extras/1e86f2c57176a0da2622c6b0af73df42.poster.avif?t=1758926288\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/extras/1e86f2c57176a0da2622c6b0af73df42.webm?t=1758926288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/extras/1e86f2c57176a0da2622c6b0af73df42.mp4?t=1758926288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delivery Survivor</strong> is an Arena Shooter Action Roguelike game. As a competent delivery staff you descend into the dungeon to deliver packages.  Acquire special relics, gather weapons, level up your character, plan your route and fight hundreds and thousands of bizarre creatures in the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delivery Survivors</strong> plays like a combination of Vampire Survivors and Slay the Spire. Once you\u2019re defeated, your journey comes to an end\u2014but don\u2019t worry. Along the way, you can obtain and upgrade different weapons, as well as collect special relics that influence the game, helping you overcome endless waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire various weapons and relics to defeat hordes of monsters and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge dungeons in a Vampire Survivors-like gameplay, strengthening yourself through wave after wave of battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the map, with each run offering a different experience.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4033640?t=1758926288","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4033640?t=1758926288","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/0906d840f05d3d03624aefad0dde864ee59c68b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758926288","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/0906d840f05d3d03624aefad0dde864ee59c68b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758926288","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/extras/1e86f2c57176a0da2622c6b0af73df42.poster.avif?t=1758926288\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/extras/1e86f2c57176a0da2622c6b0af73df42.webm?t=1758926288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/extras/1e86f2c57176a0da2622c6b0af73df42.mp4?t=1758926288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delivery Survivor</strong> is an Arena Shooter Action Roguelike game. As a competent delivery staff you descend into the dungeon to deliver packages.  Acquire special relics, gather weapons, level up your character, plan your route and fight hundreds and thousands of bizarre creatures in the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delivery Survivors</strong> plays like a combination of Vampire Survivors and Slay the Spire. Once you\u2019re defeated, your journey comes to an end\u2014but don\u2019t worry. Along the way, you can obtain and upgrade different weapons, as well as collect special relics that influence the game, helping you overcome endless waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire various weapons and relics to defeat hordes of monsters and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge dungeons in a Vampire Survivors-like gameplay, strengthening yourself through wave after wave of battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the map, with each run offering a different experience.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Barbarian Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/2574a1eb2a7241d9e971433027c8688feead07e4/header.jpg?t=1758926288","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4033640/930320174/88c04181cc991f3127d4902f66e01907eebaf10a/1758923744/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758926287","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4033640/930320174/88c04181cc991f3127d4902f66e01907eebaf10a/1758923744/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758926287","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4033640/930320174/88c04181cc991f3127d4902f66e01907eebaf10a/1758923744/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758926287","id":257207123,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257207123/movie480.mp4?t=1758926287","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257207123/movie_max.mp4?t=1758926287"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257207123/25ad908989398182e77701383e8592656f97938c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758926287","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trail